{"card_hash": "20e7684d2fe857e2271ba7cd2a2888d46069262f123c6b619a5c02ca33da556a", "channel": "Mahax", "chars": 54479, "chars_all_clips": 54479, "chars_chosen_clips": 1200, "clip_count": 38, "clips": [{"deep_link": "https://x.com/Mahaximus_/status/2088693280674291785#t=0", "end": 119.909, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "fb42e45f2d85d5ec1ca64d0dddc6c8e495c955f69e59a8ef4714e939fd7396fe", "start": 0.24, "text": "So I'm delighted to be here. And, you know what's happening in AI? I don't if you've noticed but it is a thing these days and we have many people at Google working on this area so presenting the work of not just my works but many other peop", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/Mahaximus_/status/2088693280674291785#t=1547", "end": 1666.42, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "68ea25b06a17d0381c1b6bfb925a2f55e671d26d34daf1bca6cd0db0bb730e37", "start": 1547.359, "text": "Things And Then Be Able To Automatically Learn Not Just Those Experts But Also Learn The Routing Mechanism To Learn Which Pieces Of Model Actually Activate For Different Examples So It Gives The Model Much Larger Capacity But Still Keeps Th", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/Mahaximus_/status/2088693280674291785#t=2263", "end": 2382.86, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "c95a7b27eed75d2f84906dc37675acad969263f36ffa4d59e060f7488f234a54", "start": 2263.469, "text": "Last You Know Four Or Five Years I Would Say Reinforcement Learning Has Become Much More Important In Eliciting The Desired Properties These Models Have So Given A Pre-trained Model Where You Just Exposed It To A Whole Bunch Of Training Dat", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/Mahaximus_/status/2088693280674291785#t=2722", "end": 2842.929, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "e133ae55f31112a8e665e393109a3c26941abc69282be7f0f8c7f2b360d38db0", "start": 2722.96, "text": "5 Most Recently 3 Um And One Of Things We Wanted Was For The Model To Be Multi-modal From Start Uh In Particular We Think It's Really Important That Deal With Language With Audio With Images Am Video As Well Other Non Human Modalities Like ", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/Mahaximus_/status/2088693280674291785#t=3800", "end": 3919.88, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "d0efd4fa9f598d4c0c12753f644dd4d42cb4b53ed4b1133622075ebfa897338e", "start": 3800.0, "text": "Think One Million Tokens Of Context Is Quite Useful That Gives You 1,000 Pages Or Hours Of Video Whatever But It Seems Like Even More Usefull To Be Able To Attend Trillion Tokens Of Stuff Rather Than 1,000 Million And So I Think Hybrid Syst", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}], "current_topic": "AI and ML", "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpts": [{"deep_link": "https://x.com/Mahaximus_/status/2088693280674291785#t=0", "end": 119.909, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "fb42e45f2d85d5ec1ca64d0dddc6c8e495c955f69e59a8ef4714e939fd7396fe", "start": 0.24, "text": "So I'm delighted to be here. And, you know what's happening in AI? I don't if you've noticed but it is a thing these days and we have many people at Google working on this area so presenting the work of not just my works but many other peop", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/Mahaximus_/status/2088693280674291785#t=1547", "end": 1666.42, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "68ea25b06a17d0381c1b6bfb925a2f55e671d26d34daf1bca6cd0db0bb730e37", "start": 1547.359, "text": "Things And Then Be Able To Automatically Learn Not Just Those Experts But Also Learn The Routing Mechanism To Learn Which Pieces Of Model Actually Activate For Different Examples So It Gives The Model Much Larger Capacity But Still Keeps Th", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/Mahaximus_/status/2088693280674291785#t=2263", "end": 2382.86, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "c95a7b27eed75d2f84906dc37675acad969263f36ffa4d59e060f7488f234a54", "start": 2263.469, "text": "Last You Know Four Or Five Years I Would Say Reinforcement Learning Has Become Much More Important In Eliciting The Desired Properties These Models Have So Given A Pre-trained Model Where You Just Exposed It To A Whole Bunch Of Training Dat", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/Mahaximus_/status/2088693280674291785#t=2722", "end": 2842.929, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "e133ae55f31112a8e665e393109a3c26941abc69282be7f0f8c7f2b360d38db0", "start": 2722.96, "text": "5 Most Recently 3 Um And One Of Things We Wanted Was For The Model To Be Multi-modal From Start Uh In Particular We Think It's Really Important That Deal With Language With Audio With Images Am Video As Well Other Non Human Modalities Like ", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/Mahaximus_/status/2088693280674291785#t=3800", "end": 3919.88, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "d0efd4fa9f598d4c0c12753f644dd4d42cb4b53ed4b1133622075ebfa897338e", "start": 3800.0, "text": "Think One Million Tokens Of Context Is Quite Useful That Gives You 1,000 Pages Or Hours Of Video Whatever But It Seems Like Even More Usefull To Be Able To Attend Trillion Tokens Of Stuff Rather Than 1,000 Million And So I Think Hybrid Syst", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/Mahaximus_/status/2088693280674291785", "end": null, "evidence_kind": "text_only", "excerpt_id": "e3ff4dd930380bf48120d75462a2f85a106a2f0ced1f36a98ca086eccc0acf31", "start": null, "text": "\u003c!-- HOOK_START --\u003e \u003c!-- HOOK_END --\u003e Ex-Google Jeff Dean just dropped a 1-hour lecture on full AI engineering: from LLMs to Graphs  1:45 - LLM from scratch 17:22 - How to use AI models 30:03 - Prompt engineering 52:35 - One human coordinat", "timing": "not_timed", "truncated": true}], "hint": 